  "ingredients": [
    "1 (16 ounce) can refried beans",
    "0.75 onion, diced",
    "5 (10 inch) flour tortillas",
    "1 cup salsa",
    "2 cups shredded Cheddar or Colby Jack cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Spray a 9-inch pie pan with non-stick cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Pqx4aIkgy7ZmyhYG_SkGvVzzQps=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16560-5-ingredient-mexican-casserole-VAT-005-step-01-c2c2cfe1fa074feb876ee6b08f2dc5db.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16560/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a saucepan, cook refried beans and onions (to soften them) on medium-high heat for about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/84QoiX_9_BbKWTwRknzSsyd3LtA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16560-5-ingredient-mexican-casserole-VAT-006-step-02-ff56b042da754ea08460ef58186de686.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16560/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place one tortilla in the bottom of the greased pan. Spread about 1/3 cup of the bean mixture over it. Layer a few tablespoons of salsa over this. Then, place another tortilla over the salsa, and add more of the bean mixture. Follow the beans with a big handful of cheese, spreading evenly. repeat layers, spreading the ingredients evenly over the tortillas. On the top layer, make sure to use lots of salsa and cheese!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Dn9bW_MG-fcIGPe6nDmhCN_GpNg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16560-5-ingredient-mexican-casserole-VAT-007-step-03-e5276199fd6b403f9141c91acd282e2f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16560/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake until the cheese is melted, approximately 15 to 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TP2g2HKwm2OJyu3mO02SlaoxnWs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16560-5-ingredient-mexican-casserole-VAT-001-Beauty-4x3-a8e367a865ee4ef79f2c7267fbb476c3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16560/step_04.webp"
    }
